Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.9 DW3_START_MODE_ONCE test hook

DW3_START_MODE forces the mode of every newGame(), and the restart hotkey
(patch 0046) calls newGame() again, so a replay that boots into a forced
mode would restart into the same mode. With DW3_START_MODE_ONCE set only the
boot newGame honours DW3_START_MODE, so a restart reaches the real boot screen
(US title, EU language select). PC test hook only; nothing changes when the
variable is unset.

--- a/src/engine/game/state.c
+++ b/src/engine/game/state.c
@@ -30,10 +30,19 @@
 #if PORT_HOST
     {
         const char *start = getenv("DW3_START_MODE");
+        const char *once = getenv("DW3_START_MODE_ONCE");
+        static int start_mode_used;
         char *end = NULL;
         long mode;
 
+        /* P6.9 test hook: with DW3_START_MODE_ONCE set, only the boot newGame
+           honours DW3_START_MODE; the restart hotkey's newGame then lands on
+           the real boot screen instead of the forced mode again. */
+        if (once != NULL && once[0] != '\0' && start_mode_used) {
+            start = NULL;
+        }
         if (start != NULL && start[0] != '\0') {
+            start_mode_used = 1;
             mode = strtol(start, &end, 0);
             if (end != start && mode > 0) {
                 GAME.mode = (s32)mode;
